            <ArticleTitle>Management of headaches in children and adolescents.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>81-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Deciding whether a child's headache is functional or organic is difficult for even the experienced physician. This review examines the diagnosis and management of headache syndromes in children and adolescents. A systematic history and examination together with selected laboratory data will enable the practitioner to establish the correct diagnosis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
